<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="892745296"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:20.840"><div begin="22.913" end="42.982" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="22.913" end="27.753" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.913" end="24.289">给我</span><span begin="24.289" end="24.858">信</span><span begin="24.858" end="25.508">心</span> <span begin="25.508" end="26.447">当我未</span><span begin="26.447" end="26.714">如</span><span begin="26.714" end="27.753">愿</span></p><p begin="27.963" end="32.751" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.963" end="28.592">披</span><span begin="28.592" end="29.175">雨</span><span begin="29.175" end="30.478">戴风问寒</span><span begin="30.478" end="31.779">送我</span><span begin="31.779" end="32.751">暖</span></p><p begin="32.887" end="38.043" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.887" end="33.574">亲</span><span begin="33.574" end="34.237">切</span><span begin="34.237" end="34.895">眼</span><span begin="34.895" end="35.510">光</span> <span begin="35.510" end="36.525">舒我乱</span><span begin="36.525" end="36.775">和</span><span begin="36.775" end="38.043">倦</span></p><p begin="38.653" end="42.982" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.653" end="39.356">从无</span><span begin="39.356" end="39.954">更改</span><span begin="39.954" end="40.572">心照</span><span begin="40.572" end="41.890">总不</span><span begin="41.890" end="42.982">宣</span></p></div><div begin="43.685" end="1:09.834" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="43.685" end="48.654" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.685" end="45.052">长长</span><span begin="45.052" end="45.601">路中</span> <span begin="45.601" end="46.170">走到</span><span begin="46.170" end="47.122">那里</span><span begin="47.122" end="47.705">生命</span><span begin="47.705" end="48.654">里</span></p><p begin="48.764" end="52.970" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.764" end="50.765">有你我方找到</span><span begin="50.765" end="51.331">生存</span><span begin="51.331" end="51.650">来</span><span begin="51.650" end="